@--[end]. Every man after death lives to eternity; therefore no Angel or Spirit ever thinks about death, nay, they do not know at all what it is to die; wherefore, when "death" is mentioned in the Word, there is understood by the Angels either damnation, which is death in the spiritual sense, or the continuation of life and resurrection.

