@NJHD 9. However they may differ in truths...

@DP 38. Yet (these delights) differ little on the mere surface.

@CL 171[2]. They who differ in dispositions and disagree in affections...

@SE 626. There cannot exist any true difference between the spiritual and the celestial, but only among the natural.

