@BE 58. These dogmas can only be learned with great difficulty.

@SE 499. Thus (He rules the universe) without any difficulty.

@2951. How difficultly man can be persuaded...

@5541. It is not grievous and difficult...

@5793. That to live as a Christian is not difficult in the heavenly doctrine...

