@5208[end]. Whatever is not in and dependent on some general principle, is dissipated. References.

@5222[end]. (The notion that the spirit) will be dissipated.

@5651[2]. Unless the Natural... becomes nothing, good... is dissipated.

@5820. Unless truth becomes good... it is dissipated when the man comes into the other life.

