@451. A faith in three Persons of the same Divinity in successive order...

@457. They who, from confirmation, deny the Divinity of the Lord...

@636. As, if the Divinity of the Lord is denied, the Christian Church dies out.

@SE 6093. On the three Persons of the Godhead.

@Ath 167. On this account, the Mohammedans have denied the Divinity of the Lord...

@CanonsNC 40. Trinity. 2. 10. From this it follows, that the Divinity and the soul of the Son of God, our Saviour, are not distinctly two, but one and the same.

@CanonsNC 40. Trinity. 3. 6. A trinity of Persons in the Godhead is from the Nicene Council...

